 91	**vs. Executing Plans (parallel session):**
 92	- Same session (no context switch)
 93	- Fresh subagent per task (no context pollution)
 94	- Two-stage review after each task: spec compliance first, then code quality
 95	- Faster iteration (no human-in-loop between tasks)
